    "answer_en": "My Microsoft 365 governance model combines ownership, identity, information protection, lifecycle and recoverability. Entra groups/roles and Conditional Access control who and what can connect; Intune/device compliance protects managed endpoints; SharePoint/Teams/OneDrive need provisioning, ownership, sharing and guest rules; sensitivity/retention policies should reflect data classification; Exchange needs anti-phishing and secure mail controls. I would define who can create high-impact resources, how guests and inactive workspaces are reviewed, and how data is retained or deleted. Audit logging, Secure Score/risk indicators and service health feed review. I also separate Microsoft service availability from data recovery—versioning/retention and, where required, Microsoft 365 Backup or another approved backup strategy address accidental deletion or ransomware recovery.",
