    "question_ar": "مدير يريد dashboard فوق بيانات S3 مع أحداث تشغيل شبه لحظية. ما خدمات AWS التي قد تجمعها؟",
    "answer_en": "For data already in S3, I can use AWS Glue for catalog/ETL where needed, Athena for serverless SQL querying and QuickSight for visualization. If the requirement includes a continuous event stream, Kinesis can ingest/process streaming data before it lands in an analytics store or drives near-real-time processing. I would not add every service by default: first define latency, volume, schema, retention, user concurrency and governance. A simple daily dashboard may need only S3 + catalog + Athena + QuickSight; real-time alerting may need a different event path entirely.",
