    "answer_en": "My experience is strongest in enterprise applications and service governance. At UPA I have governed a multi-platform national ecosystem spanning procurement, inventory, warehousing, data and reporting, including Microsoft Dynamics 365 ERP/CRM connectivity, integrations, support models, access, change/release, continuity and vendor coordination. I treat an ERP as an operational service, not only software: named business and technical owners, support tiers, integration and master-data controls, lifecycle, auditability, performance and DR. For ITSM, I use the same discipline around incident, problem, change, service requests, SLAs, escalation and knowledge. That operating model transfers directly to WaCA's mix of enterprise platforms, including NetSuite and UniField, while I would learn the application-specific configuration from the functional owners and specialists.",
    "question_ar": "صف خبرتك في إدارة أنظمة تخطيط موارد المؤسسة (ERP) أو أنظمة إدارة الخدمات/التذاكر (ITSM).",
